{"name": "THORNSPELL", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Clip of gameplay featuring a grid of plants earning score as they get activated. The enemy is a swarm of bugs.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/c5f66ee398283c2148688617bc629b12.poster.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/c5f66ee398283c2148688617bc629b12.webm?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/c5f66ee398283c2148688617bc629b12.mp4?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The forest, your home, is in danger. Wield the power of plants, unmask the evil forces corrupting nature, and banish them away to protect your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THORNSPELL</strong> is a deckbuilding AND gardenbuilding roguelike where you will strategize to create the most powerful garden, while your foes will attempt to burn it to the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find unexpected combinations, experiment with different strategies, and snowball the growth of your garden to score big numbers and succeed in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"172\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/25c3af128f7281bfe8e8a6b7430d9ead.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"719\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Clip of gameplay where the cursor selects a plant, and then a place on the grid to place the previously selected plant.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/abcc91c592840b80b335cf6c99d0b6c9.poster.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/abcc91c592840b80b335cf6c99d0b6c9.webm?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/abcc91c592840b80b335cf6c99d0b6c9.mp4?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place plants from your deck in strategic formations, and trigger them to unleash their effects at the right place and time. Some effects only trigger when your plants are <strong>watered</strong>, others when <strong>harvested</strong>, or even when <strong>destroyed</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"176\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/bb0f18789f7e97cfa899771d541e94ce.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"717\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Clip of gameplay featuring a shop. The cursor hovers over different plants to show their descriptions.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/38280d604d3ede7f5072df55fd82888a.poster.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/38280d604d3ede7f5072df55fd82888a.webm?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/38280d604d3ede7f5072df55fd82888a.mp4?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage both your deck of plants, and your deck of actions simultaneously, finding the <strong>best combinations</strong>, or the most ludicrous and <strong>unexpected synergies</strong>. Decide carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"177\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/facb951e124e34321ca541d7b00d3bec.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"700\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Clip of gameplay featuring a grid of plants. The cursor highlights a couple of items, revealing the areas they affect and their purpose.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/10afeb8358eae7bcfd3e7bb93e6c66ae.poster.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/10afeb8358eae7bcfd3e7bb93e6c66ae.webm?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/10afeb8358eae7bcfd3e7bb93e6c66ae.mp4?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Placement matters for your relics too! Explore different positions within your garden, and ensure they are <strong>overlapping the critical pieces</strong> of your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"173\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/ca8c489683f72f3682844fc610294d71.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"700\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Clip of gameplay featuring a grid of plants earning score as they get activated. The enemy is a menacing crow with multiple flaming eyes.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/5b3349ed5926896c397e3f670aa23679.poster.avif?t=1787843459\" width=\"960\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/5b3349ed5926896c397e3f670aa23679.webm?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/extras/5b3349ed5926896c397e3f670aa23679.mp4?t=1787843459\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your strategies against a wide array of foes. If your magical garden is powerful enough to protect the forest, you will claim victory ...but if it is not, <strong>you will have to start over!</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Embody a magical florist by placing plants strategically in your garden, and watering them to score points. THORNSPELL is a garden-building roguelike where you will create and unleash chains of magical effects, dispelling the corruption spreading through your home.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514920/0c545392e91b160acd918bf94da664699b360f46/header.jpg?t=1787843459", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Game", "Roguelike", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Deckbuilding", "Singleplayer", "Strategy"], "developers": "MODACH GAMES", "publishers": "MODACH GAMES", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4514920", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 May 2026 - Request Access\n\n26 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/whnX3SXMDuU", "first_seen": 1779573600.0, "review_rank": 576}